From: pdx203 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: gpu: 8 GiB aperture, sixteen client windows

The GPU context's aperture is 8 GiB (33 input bits; the SMMU context takes the least input size that holds its range),
the phone's RAM: a window is only a ceiling, the physical pool stays the limit. Sixteen windows instead of eleven: the
render server's 1984 MiB (1216), six large ones of 768 MiB (three of 640) and nine small ones of 160 MiB (seven of 128).
The level-1 tables are 4105 pages (16 MiB, 2053 for 4 GiB). The board publishes 33 input bits and va_size to 8 GiB.

